{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n 佐々木久美です🦒\n \n \n 遅くなりましたが、\n 新年の明けましておめでとうございます。\n 2021年も日向坂46をよろしくお願い致します🌞💙\n \n \n \n 今年は自分自身に自信を持てる年にしたいです！\n なんだか難しい文章になりましたが、、（笑）\n 佐々木久美としての発信も\n 怠らないようにしたいです頑張ります🦒\n \n \n \n \n 年末は紅白歌合戦で2020最後のパフォーマンスを\n させていただきました🐭❤️\n \n 写真沢山〜！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAFA8A1VXV3WRSF2KQVDV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAGATT1GDMYSF7CYP56NP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAHCHMHK8GNSK7GC61KP3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAJEJVBW0TBFKQS9X1BP7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAKG2F7C96BYYFQKWEP8Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 紅白の衣装は回るとヒラっヒラする\n お花柄のラブリーちゃんでした💠\n あっという間でしたが、\n 楽しくパフォーマンスできました🥰\n あのステージに立てたということが本当に嬉しいです。\n \n \n エンディングも出させていただきました！\n 理佐さんのお隣でうふふ\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAMK74CJWKPH2QV2MKTQW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 残ったメンバーと一緒に年越しもできて\n 最高のスタート切れた気がしています🐮💙\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HANMT0CFPF3654GMAZNK0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAPNTWQBVBVPAK6MAZ22C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HAQQKRVNR0J2QBQA8BVHQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HARQGAF9BZ9XT7J8DM48V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 最後の写真は私がお願いしたら撮ってくれました\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HASQE0C1ER3P0A27GVAV6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n とっておきの恋人ポーズ💘\n 京子の写真集もうすぐだね〜わくわく\n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}